\ The hand-spliced baseline for Phase 4 slice 7b's dogfood. Its capturing-
\ closure twin `examples/capturing_dispatch.sth` builds a dispatch table of
\ closures, each capturing a shared borrow and reading one element; this
\ version reads the same three elements directly, with no closure, no
\ dispatch table, and no `call`. The golden pins both to the same output.

import: intrinsics * ;

: main ( -- )
  7 3 fill | arr |
  &!arr 1 >usize &!> 8 !
  &!arr 2 >usize &!> 9 !
  &arr 0 &> @ .
  &arr 1 &> @ .
  &arr 2 &> @ .
  arr drop ;
